# Credentials. `.env.example` is committed as a template; a real `.env` never is.
# Nothing here is read by the harness at runtime — it reads the process environment —
# but a key pasted into one of these files must not be able to reach a commit.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
!tests/**/*.pem

